12940  pad tap dpdown
12950  pad tap dpdown
12960  pad tap dpdown
12980  pad tap a
13020  expect tv-more=1
13020  expect menu-open=1
13020  pad down misc1
13640  expect menu-open=0
13640  expect tv-more=0
13640  expect settings-open=0
13640  expect paused=0
13660  pad up misc1
13700  expect settings-open=0

# A game dropped on the window while it is open from the Base layer: the game starts, the window goes (no game is left behind a TV-sized
